 The Help System: Top Level
 --------------------------
   Welcome to the help system of ^nodename.  Here are the top level
topics to pick from; if what you want doesn't seem to be immediately
available, just pick the topic that seems closest to what you want
and soon you should find it.

 %NEWUSER  This is a help file for confused and/or lost new users.
 %COMMANDS  This will lead you to the commands, including NOVICE help.
 %BOARD  Some information on system specific features and miscellanea.
 %GENERAL  General information, BBS lists, etc.
 %PHILOSOPHY A short philosophy of Citadel and it's use.
 %HELPOPT  Complete list of help files.
 %AUGSJ  Helpful information on the Amiga User's Group
 %STU  Special Offer for AUGSJ members.
 %VXL-30  Special pricing for users of this BBS!
 %Insite  How you too can get a 20 MB floppy!

